WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.480
Relajarse.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.480
I have no intention of sharing the bed.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:13.920
Good night.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:17.920
Hey.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.960
Do you really want

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.200
me with you in Baltimore tomorrow?

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.520
Of course.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.520
I even ordered you a dress.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.760
You ordered...

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.600
a dress for me?
